# Performance Features (Pillar 3: Performance Revolution)

This directory will contain implementations for:
- WebGPU Rendering (Q1 2026)
- Tiled Rendering for 32K+ canvases (Q1 2026)
- Adaptive Quality System (Q1 2026)
- Compute Shaders (Q2 2026)
- Multi-GPU Support (Q2 2026)
- WebAssembly Core (Q3 2026)

See FEATURES_V3.md for detailed specifications.
